{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart holds no blood... you must recreate it by gradually gathering the elements that compose it.\u00a0Squeeze (click) the heart to gain power and lifeforce as your rise to strength begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957540/extras/431314457878aec0014965663fda1316.apng?t=1774627174\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957540/extras/431314457878aec0014965663fda1316.poster.avif?t=1774627174\" class=\"bb_img\" width=144 height=354 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tabs. Each with it's own organ, gimmick and resource(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957540/extras/90f45ef780ec756e22b0b5349f4329b3.avif?t=1774627174\" width=464 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active and idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades that speed up gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ different tabs, each with it's unique incremental quirk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree to boost your resources, unlock gameplay elements and help you along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games (optional, if you prefer more active gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique upgrades and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft-prestige (applies to specific stuff and does not fully reset the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline progress</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.co